        <mxCell id="c57" value="The year&#x27;s materiality screen, 5% of income before income taxes as recorded" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="28" y="540" width="520" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c58" value="&lt;i&gt;Each bar is the revaluation of the manufactured finished goods made since the ledger opened and on hand at the year-end, as the movements rebuild them: at the proposed rate, with no indirect hours (the labor-content case) and with supervision and depreciation spread over 90% and 110% of the plan volume. The screens are 256,718 for fiscal 2025 and 225,181 for fiscal 2026; the revaluation is a sensitivity on next year&#x27;s plan, not an established error.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="568" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
